      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皇帝”鲁道夫象征在观众席上。\n她的身旁……出现了某个赛马娘的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f882e273ef480c5c963fd27f948a155df2f6f15a07ab8c782cf877b9c210fc8b",
