      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使不能跑出原有的水准也一定会赢。\n因为我要……超越“皇帝”。\n因为我是带来奇迹的无敌“帝王”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b302308adaef98d1a7697ac63a277219edb13f40b8cedafb62967a5907ac5bcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
