      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，自己更得吞没对方的奇迹，\n并成为最快的风──\n两人期待已久的对决终于要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c9aa4d546e0017fa7a677a19f01b07458b282a6f7dbf6ebfd87b0d021dc838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
