      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉跑出了优异的表现。\n并因此确信，\n只有在闪耀系列赛才能实现成为风的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97630d5b39c1e7b0655c72072fec1a313f022e0c8f898ae1926bf4b0b51ddbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
