      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先要先花时间锻炼好体能。\n下一个目标定为春季重赏比赛“新西兰T”。\n两人商讨过后得出这个结论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e6abdbc1bd7ee57cb237bbbf49b9c8dcb936827d4d12538f75c4c9c1ed12125",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
