      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉跑出了优秀的成绩。\n这场比赛甚至让她获益良多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe9a6ab6e489fede06e81779ce383b00eb30d4d29ed8ea77ebcd2d309dcca7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
