      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉似乎因此深受激励。\n这时训练员提出下一个目标……\n希望挑战1200米的短距离战“葵S”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c8d9fdf2338b61a0bb0e9dddcc1be72d083aca446a4c6d994af0d3bd17468",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ece7520af7a3d9e4e453d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“葵S”磨练速度后，\n下一个目标就是……GⅠ竞赛！\n打起精神准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beac39a8e41fd64e63e11761a53203682236fe6526daa88223085d4e71c1d4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
